  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a small saucepan over medium heat. Add the diced onion with a pinch of salt and cook for 5 minutes, stirring often, until soft and starting to turn golden.",
    "Add the garlic, tomato paste, smoked paprika, and dried thyme. Cook for 1 minute, stirring, until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the canned tomatoes, brown sugar, red wine vinegar, tamari, cannellini beans, the remaining salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring to a gentle simmer, then cook for 10 to 12 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the sauce has thickened and the beans are glossy and hot.",
    "Toast the bread until crisp and golden.",
    "Spoon the baked beans over the toast and serve immediately."
